<h2>Asobi 0.2 (build 367)</h2>
<p><b>Live tracker status on your frame grabs.</b></p>
<ul>
<li>A new plugin seam, <code>hud_tokens</code>, adds burn-in lines to frame grabs — shot status from your tracker, delivery dates, anything a pipeline can answer. Drop an executable in the Asobi Plugins folder that prints label/value pairs; each renders as its own plate under the main burn-in row. A slow or failing provider costs its lines, never the export. Contract in PLUGINS.md.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
