<h2>Asobi 0.2 (build 364)</h2>
<p><b>Editorial formats are now a plugin seam.</b></p>
<ul>
<li>Import Timeline / conform can be taken over by a studio's own converter: drop an executable named <code>edl_adapter</code> into the Asobi Plugins folder (or the pipeline plugins directory) and it reads every cut the user picks — proprietary formats included. Same drop-in mechanics as the tracker provider; the contract is two arguments in, OTIO out, documented in PLUGINS.md.</li>
<li>Without a plugin, nothing changes: CMX3600, FCP7 XML, FCPXML and AAF keep working exactly as before. Which adapter handled a conform is always visible, never silent.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
